 * Applies a selection diff to a partial selection state.
 * MUST apply the array diff for each key present in the selection diff.
 * [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻shared🔖types🔖granularhooktypes🔖standardemptyconstants🔖genericdifftypes🛠️applyselectiondiff](repo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/shared.ts/s/Types/s/Granular%20Hook%20Types/s/Standard%20Empty%20Constants/s/Generic%20Diff%20Types/d/i/applySelectionDiff)
